<div n="3" type="jArticle">                   <dateline>                      <hi rendition="#b">Perlin,</hi> 29. December.</dateline>                    <bibl>(Priv.-Tel. d. &#x201E;M.<lb/>
Tagbl.&#x201C;)</bibl>                    <p>Nach Privatdepe&#x017F;chen aus Kamerun<lb/>
